# Mobile / Cloud First

The owner primarily works from a phone (cursor.com/agents). Laptop is optional.

## How to work

- Prefer **Cloud Agents** over local laptop agents whenever the repo has a GitHub remote.
- After finishing a task, open/continue the next highest-impact live-prep item on a cloud branch (do not wait for "continue").
- Commit on the cloud branch and open a PR when the fix is ready.
- Never require the user to keep a laptop open for agent compute.
- Chat replies to the user may be Hindi; all product/UI text stays English.

## Do not

- Do not delete production pages or run broad remote deletes.
- Do not invent or commit credentials (`config.php`, `.vscode/sftp.json`, API keys).
- Do not force-push or hard-reset unless the user explicitly asks.
